<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3364828008"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6771681226"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="君のせいで愛してる"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="CHiCO with HoneyWorks"/><amll:meta key="album" value="君のせいで愛してる"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:45.080"><div begin="00:01.066" end="03:34.512"><p begin="00:01.066" end="00:03.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">ねぇねぇ「愛してる」って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以下歌词翻译由文曲大模型提供</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ne 「 a i shi te ru 」 't te</span></p><p begin="00:03.699" end="00:08.259" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">私見て言ってくれたご褒美<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那句看着我说出的奖励 还是算了吧♡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi mi te i 't te ku re ta go ho u bi ya me ta ♡</span></p><p begin="00:10.109" end="00:11.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">...やめた♡<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">…还是算了♡</span></p><p begin="00:20.088" end="00:22.488" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">スクロール止めちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">刷着屏幕却忍不住停下指尖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ku ro o ru to me cha u</span></p><p begin="00:23.439" end="00:26.297" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">声がしたら聞いちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要听到你的声音就想侧耳倾听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e ga shi ta ra ki i cha u</span></p><p begin="00:27.158" end="00:30.617" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">自信がなくて嘘が増えても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便因为缺乏自信而谎言不断</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji shi n ga na ku te u so ga fu e te mo</span></p><p begin="00:30.813" end="00:33.417" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">まっすぐな気持ち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份心情依旧率真</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 's su gu na ki mo chi</span></p><p begin="00:34.556" end="00:37.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">勘違いしちゃうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会让我产生误会的呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n chi ga i shi cha u yo</span></p><p begin="00:38.038" end="00:40.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">顔赤いのバレてる？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脸红的样子被发现了吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka o a ka i no ba re te ru ?</span></p><p begin="00:41.589" end="00:45.238" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">些細なことで胸が躍って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因些许琐事便心潮澎湃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa sa i na ko to de mu ne ga o do 't te</span></p><p begin="00:45.390" end="00:47.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">甘酸っぱいのです<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是酸酸甜甜的感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma zu 'p pa i no de su</span></p><p begin="00:49.119" end="00:52.678" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">距離を縮める言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要拉近距离的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo ri wo chi di me ru ko to ba</span></p><p begin="00:52.777" end="00:55.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">見当たらないのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明还无处可寻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi a ta ra na i no ni</span></p><p begin="00:56.418" end="00:59.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">振り向いた君の顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你蓦然回首时的脸庞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri mu i ta ki mi no ka o</span></p><p begin="00:59.999" end="01:03.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">近くて吐息触れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">近在咫尺 气息相触 满是恋爱的味道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ka ku te to i ki fu re te ko i no a ji shi te ru</span></p><p begin="01:03.745" end="01:06.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">恋の味してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尝到了恋爱的味道</span></p><p begin="01:06.372" end="01:09.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">ねぇねぇ「愛してる」って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 呐 说什么“我爱你”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ne 「 a i shi te ru 」 't te</span></p><p begin="01:09.150" end="01:13.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">君を見て言って困らせていい？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果看着你这样说 让你感到困扰可以吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo mi te i 't te ko ma ra se te i i ?</span></p><p begin="01:13.768" end="01:16.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">なんて駆け引きとかね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种所谓的恋爱心机</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te ka ke hi ki to ka ne</span></p><p begin="01:16.404" end="01:18.648" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">ほんとは苦手よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我最不擅长了啊 请快点发现吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to ha ni ga te yo a ki zu i te</span></p><p begin="01:18.730" end="01:20.537" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">あぁ気づいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 快察觉到吧</span></p><p begin="01:21.866" end="01:25.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">好きになるって痛いのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然坠入爱河会让人隐隐作痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ni na ru 't te i ta i no ni</span></p><p begin="01:25.291" end="01:27.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">溢れたら止まれない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可一旦溢出便再也无法止步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re ta ra to ma re na i</span></p><p begin="01:35.486" end="01:38.891" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">他の子には優しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对别的女孩子那么温柔 对我却这么冷淡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ka no ko ni ha ya sa shi i tsu me ta i yo wa ta shi ni</span></p><p begin="01:40.033" end="01:42.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">冷たいよ私に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却对我又冷淡起来</span></p><p begin="01:43.486" end="01:46.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">名前呼びもボディータッチも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论是呼唤名字还是肢体接触</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ma e yo bi mo bo di i ta 'c chi mo</span></p><p begin="01:47.204" end="01:50.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">私だったらいいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要是对象全都是我就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi da 't ta ra i i no ni</span></p><p begin="01:50.987" end="01:54.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">愛想尽かされたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便被你嫌弃也是无可奈何</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i so tsu ka sa re ta 't te shi ka ta na i ho do</span></p><p begin="01:54.619" end="01:57.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">仕方ないほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也是理所当然</span></p><p begin="01:58.147" end="02:01.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">わがままな恋心<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这任性的恋慕之心 也是我的一部分</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ga ma ma na ko i go ko ro so re su ra wa ta shi da ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:01.751" end="02:05.457" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">それすら私だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但就是这样的我</span></p><p begin="02:05.457" end="02:08.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">好きにさせてみせる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定要让你也喜欢上我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ni sa se te mi se ru</span></p><p begin="02:08.208" end="02:10.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">妄想「可愛すぎ」って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妄想着你夸我“太可爱了”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u so u 「 ka wa i su gi 」 't te</span></p><p begin="02:10.964" end="02:15.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">私見て言ってくれたご褒美<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后看着我 给我一份奖励</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi mi te i 't te ku re ta go ho u bi</span></p><p begin="02:15.421" end="02:18.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">なんてアニメじゃないし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可惜这又不是什么动画片</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te a ni me ja na i shi</span></p><p begin="02:18.214" end="02:20.477" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">キスシーンもないし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也没有什么接吻的场景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki su shi i n mo na i shi</span></p><p begin="02:20.477" end="02:22.395" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">あぁバカみたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 我就像个笨蛋一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ba ka mi ta i</span></p><p begin="02:23.639" end="02:27.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">好きになるって痛いから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为坠入爱河太痛苦了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ni na ru 't te i ta i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:27.060" end="02:29.773" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">ヒロインになれない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我才当不成女主角</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ro i n ni na re na i</span></p><p begin="02:45.494" end="02:47.103" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">聞いていい？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以问你吗？禁止撒谎哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki i te i i ? u so ki n shi</span></p><p begin="02:47.241" end="02:48.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">嘘、禁止<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">禁止撒谎哦</span></p><p begin="02:49.108" end="02:52.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">あの子のこと気になるの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你很在意那个女孩子吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ko no ko to ki ni na ru no ?</span></p><p begin="02:52.759" end="02:59.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">「他にいる気になる子…まだ、言えない。」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我有别的在意的人 只是 现在还不能说”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ho ka ni i ru ki ni na ru ko ma da i e na i 」</span></p><p begin="02:59.142" end="03:00.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">えっと…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">额 难道是我在自作多情？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e 't to wa ta shi ka mo 't te ka n chi ga i ?</span></p><p begin="03:00.986" end="03:04.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">私かもって勘違い？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难不成说的是我吗？</span></p><p begin="03:04.418" end="03:07.986" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">見つめ返しちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也试着回望你的双眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu me ka e shi cha u</span></p><p begin="03:09.178" end="03:11.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">ねぇねぇ「愛してる」って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 呐 说什么“我爱你”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ne 「 a i shi te ru 」 't te</span></p><p begin="03:11.896" end="03:16.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">君を見て言って困らせていい？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果看着你这样说 让你感到困扰可以吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo mi te i 't te ko ma ra se te i i ?</span></p><p begin="03:16.409" end="03:19.067" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">なんて駆け引きはもう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种所谓的恋爱心机</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te ka ke hi ki ha mo u</span></p><p begin="03:19.160" end="03:21.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">必要ないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经不再需要了 让我们凝视彼此吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi tsu yo u na i yo u ni mi tsu me a 't te</span></p><p begin="03:21.372" end="03:23.293" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">見つめ合って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此凝视中</span></p><p begin="03:24.594" end="03:27.996" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">好きになるって奇跡だし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能喜欢上某人本身就是奇迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ni na ru 't te ki se ki da shi</span></p><p begin="03:27.996" end="03:32.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">何度だって言うよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多少次我都会说 我好喜欢你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do da 't te i u yo su ki</span></p><p begin="03:33.147" end="03:34.512" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">好き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我喜欢你</span></p></div></body></tt>